sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant Browser
    participant App as Flask Server
    participant Logic as ANP Processor
    participant DB as Database

    Note over U, DB: Flow Analisis SPK ANP

    U->>Browser: Upload File (CSV/Excel)
    Browser->>App: POST /upload
    
    activate App
    App->>App: Validate File Extension
    
    alt File Invalid
        App-->>Browser: Flash Error & Redirect
    else File Valid
        App->>App: Save File to /uploads
        
        %% Proses Analisis
        App->>Logic: run_anp_analysis(DataFrame)
        activate Logic
        
        Logic->>Logic: Data Pre-processing
        Note right of Logic: Normalize Numeric (C1,C2)<br/>Map Categories (C3,C4,C5)
        
        Logic->>Logic: Calculate Pairwise Matrix
        Logic->>Logic: Build Supermatrix & Limit Matrix
        
        Logic-->>App: Return Result {Ranking, Chart, Weights}
        deactivate Logic
        
        %% Simpan ke Database
        App->>DB: INSERT into AnalysisHistory
        activate DB
        DB-->>App: Success
        deactivate DB
        
        %% Log Aktivitas
        App->>DB: INSERT into SystemLog
        
        App-->>Browser: Render Page (Table + Chart)
    end
    deactivate App
    
    U->>Browser: View Analysis Result